router.post(
  "/companies",
  verifyJWT,
  requirePasswordChange,
  createCompany
);


router.post(
  "/company",
  verifyJWT,
  authorizeRoles("admin"),
  createCompany
);

multiple roles

authorizeRoles(
  "admin",
  "hr",
  "trainer"
)

The only routes that should work before password change are:
POST /auth/login
POST /auth/change-first-password
POST /auth/logout
GET  /auth/me


Login
  ↓
user.mustChangePassword === true
  ↓
Redirect to Change Password Page
  ↓
POST /auth/change-first-password
  ↓
mustChangePassword = false
  ↓
Redirect to Dashboard